# Test Error Notification API - Articles & Warehouse

### 1. Get all error logs
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Get formatted error logs (with InternalPartNumber for articles/warehouse)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/formatted
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get only ARTICLES errors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?context=articles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get only WAREHOUSE errors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?context=warehouse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Get only CUSTOMERS errors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?context=customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. Get only CUSTOMER_WAREHOUSE errors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?context=customerWarehouse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Get only DISCOUNT_GROUP errors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?context=discountGroup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Get recent errors (last 24 hours)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Get errors for specific organization
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?organizationId={{orgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. Get error statistics
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/stats/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. Get specific error details
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/{{errorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12. Search errors by text
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?search=BrandID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13. Get paginated results
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 14. Get errors sorted by newest first
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. Delete old errors (bulk)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/bulk/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "olderThan": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### 16. Manual test notification - Customers
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "context": "customers",
  "organizationId": "test-org-id",
  "errorMessage": "Test customer sync error from API"
}

###

### 17. Manual test notification - Discount Groups
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "context": "discountGroup",
  "organizationId": "test-org-id",
  "errorMessage": "Test discount group sync error from API"
}

###

### 18. Manual test notification - Discount SubGroups
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "context": "discountSubGroup",
  "organizationId": "test-org-id",
  "errorMessage": "Test discount subgroup sync error from API"
}

###

### 19. Manual test notification - Orders
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "context": "orders",
  "organizationId": "test-org-id",
  "errorMessage": "Test order sync error from API"
}

###

### 20. Get formatted error logs - Discount Groups
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/formatted?context=discountGroup&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 21. Get formatted error logs - Discount SubGroups
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/formatted?context=discountSubGroup&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 22. Get formatted error logs - Orders
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/error-notifications/formatted?context=orders&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
